# A figure canvas (issue 076, from one of Marc's unhung pieces): a tall canvas in a thin pale frame, warm cream and tan, a big pale poster-like head on the left, a figure in white sitting on a red chair, dark shoes and a checkered floor. No text or signature. An abstract impression, not a copy. 32x16 wall slot, tall frame centred.
size: 32x16
